  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Butera said AI is helping both researchers and adversaries identify software flaws, accelerating vulnerability discovery while defenders struggle to keep up, and he noted that AI advancements let threat actors find and exploit vulnerabilities. He said automation can help CISA do more and that AI may help with those automation efforts. He described Gold Eagle as allowing CISA to accept vulnerability reports at scale. He expressed hope that a binding operational directive would help agencies better prioritize patching without requiring additional work.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s5",
    "s2",
    "s3",
    "s4"
   ],
   "sentences": [
